{"uid":"thag2.12","title":"Jotidāsa","reference":"Theragāthā 2.12","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["People who act harshly—","attacking people,","binding them with rope,","hurting them in all kinds of ways—","they’re treated in the same way;","their deeds don’t vanish.","Whatever deeds a person does,","whether good or bad,","they are the heir to each","and every deed they do."]}]}
